      "text": "854. 求下式的值：\n$\\frac{(y-x)^2}{x+y}\\div\\left(\\frac{2xy}{y^2-x^2}+\\frac{x}{x+y}-\\frac{y}{y-x}\\right)$\n设 $x=8.4$，$y=-0.6$。",
